WEBVTT

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:39.290
My God! I bet some punks from
the Ryuka did this!

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:42.200
Damn bastards! I'll kill
them all one day!

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.560
Hey, Mister!

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:43.700
What is it?
Hey, Mister!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.030
What is it?

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:51.540
Hurry!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.870
Dear, we must go now!

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.660
I haven't seen them around before.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.260
Yeah, must be newcomers.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:12.990
I'll take care of them.
You go after Lee.

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:13.930
Right!

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.070
Not that way.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.480
Follow me.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.570
What's your name?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.390
Not that it matters.

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:32.370
What was that about?

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:36.540
The Ryuka. They're a mafia
group from the mainland.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:43.710
A vicious turf war's going
on around here,

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:46.720
and we have no intention of losing.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.550
You lose if you lose your nerve.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.770
It's Won.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.680
Why are you helping us?

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:14.240
Because I feel like it.
Isn't that enough?

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:20.220
Remember that old man you saved?
He was on our side.

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:21.720
On your side?

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.190
Come with me.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.990
Do you have anywhere to go?

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.010
Then why don't you stay around
here for a while.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:41.030
Won, you can't decide
that on your own.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.880
Who is that man?

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:44.250
I have no idea.
Who is that man?

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.750
I have no idea.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.210
Have you forgotten!?

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:51.250
You must get permission before you
can bring strangers in here.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.820
Well, this guy saved Lee's life.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.860
Lee?

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:56.320
Yeah, he saved Lee when they tried
to run him and his place down,
Lee?

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.530
Yeah, he saved Lee when they tried
to run him and his place down,

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:00.990
risking his own life.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.770
We are indebted to him
for his willingness

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:08.130
to risk himself to save
one of our own.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.970
Yes, Elder Fan.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.840
But we don't take in strangers!

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:19.340
We are united by our willingness
to help one another.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.080
Not by a narrow-minded sense
of group solidarity!

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:23.580
Yes, Sir.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.220
But how will we take care of him?
Yes, Sir.

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:26.020
But how will we take care of him?

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:30.080
They can stay at the same place
where we'll take care of Lee.

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:33.650
At Sou's? Then we have
nothing to worry about.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.960
Will this be satisfactory? May we
extend our hospitality to you?

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:39.060
Yes, thank you very much.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.070
At six this morning,

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:47.410
violence erupted between rival
gangs in Kansai's Asian Vein.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:50.980
There have been reports of gunfire
in the surrounding blocks,

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:54.310
and retailers in the neighborhood
have suffered extensive damage.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.550
Suzu?

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.520
Did you come to welcome me home?
You don't do that often.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.230
What's wrong?

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:06.290
I have something I must ask you.
What's wrong?

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:09.030
I have something I must ask you.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.500
What is it?

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:15.370
I see, it's about Yushiro, isn't it?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.970
Also about Father and big
brother Kazukiyo.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:25.050
I'm sorry.

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:26.510
Big brother!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:39.560
All is developing just as Mr. Nishida
predicted it seems.

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:42.930
Do you mind?

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:43.300
Come in.
Do you mind?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:44.390
Come in.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.770
It's been verified.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.370
It seems that America is serious

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:52.640
about suspending grain
exports temporarily.

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:54.410
So, it was true.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.470
But how did you find out?

00:07:57.010 --> 00:08:00.140
This is something only a few
higher-ups at Cargill know about.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:06.220
We didn't find out. A man reasoned
that this would happen.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:09.120
Someone predicted this?
Who could do that?

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.950
A true genius.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:17.400
Well, regarding Yushiro,

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.130
there's nothing yet.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:21.940
How long has it been since
he's been gone?

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:24.140
About two weeks.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.000
That long already.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.800
What should we do? Suzu...

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:32.050
She's become anxious as well.

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:36.420
Keep trying a while longer, and
if we can't find him then

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:40.650
I suppose we'll have to go to our
dear father and get his advice.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:42.750
What do you mean? You wouldn't...

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.770
I must tell you how grateful we
are at your selfless action.

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:54.000
You were too kind to
me this morning.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.800
No, please, it was nothing.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:00.840
I've become a burden for you. I hope
we won't be imposing too much.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.970
And about working,

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:07.640
I'll work two people's worth, so...

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:11.950
Oh please, that's the last thing
you need worry about!

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:12.990
But...

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:13.450
Well all right, he works.
But...

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.360
Well all right, he works.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.190
Hey, what's the matter?

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:19.890
He says he'd be more comfortable
about this if he did work.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:26.470
All right! Might as well get started
since we know what to do.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:31.140
Lee, why don't you ask the kitchen
you're going to, to hire him.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:32.110
Me?

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:32.640
Yeah, if they balk, just
mention my name.
Me?

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:36.110
Yeah, if they balk, just
mention my name.

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:38.110
Well, work in the kitchen is not easy,

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:40.980
but it will keep you out of
sight from the public.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.880
Yes, yes! Then, I'll take
him with me tonight.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:48.960
Work in the kitchen is hard,
so are you sure?

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:50.420
Please, yes.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:54.080
They're no brother and sister.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:13.850
A-2, set your 30mm chain
gun to anti-air rounds.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:16.080
Set fuse to proximity
detonation mode.

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:18.550
Your target is at your two o'clock,
altitude eight meters.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.020
A-1, jump to point 03-04.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:24.890
A-2, begin ascent five point four
seconds after releasing your smoke.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.290
Pilot's response rate
down by point five,

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:30.030
change ascension timing to
eight point three seconds.

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.800
Roger, relaying new attack scenario.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:34.070
Begin Op.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:34.300
Go!
Begin Op.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.530
Go!

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:41.110
Target has increased speed
to combat speed.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.840
Moving toward eight o'clock
at one eighty knots.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:47.080
A-1, move to point 03-05,
and standby.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.990
A-1 's heart rate up to 189.
Blood pressure has risen to 172.

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:53.350
Noradrenaline secretion increase
of eight points.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:56.690
A-2's heart rate at 182,
blood pressure 169.

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:58.890
Noradrenaline secretion
rate currently steady.

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:11.360
A-1 's heart rate up to 198,
injecting stabilizer compound.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:21.640
A-2, we're synching A-1 's laser marker
to your sighting system.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.150
Designation marker synchronized.

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:25.620
Parallax correction working.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.550
BS, On!

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:32.530
A-1 's noradrenaline secretion has
increased to plus fourteen points.

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:34.790
Continued physical exertion is likely
to result in a panic attack.

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.900
Confirming kill. Target shot down.

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:47.040
Right, end training session.
Recall all units to point zero.

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.530
Roger, returning to point zero.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.780
Are you all right, Sir?

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:59.820
Yeah, how's Lieutenant Squire doing?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.690
Medics are helping him out.

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:03.090
I see.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:07.690
Sergeant, I heard there were women
piloting this thing in Belgistan.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:11.330
Supposedly Symbol's test
pilot was a woman, Sir.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:14.670
Really? What kind of a woman
could manage something

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.330
as cruel as this?

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:33.690
The police will pursue a hard
line policy with the riots

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:34.860
that are taking place in urban areas...

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:37.660
Riot police from Hokkaido have been
dispatched to Kantou and Kansai

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.690
to reinforce the ability of police
there to maintain the peace...

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.460
Another shop in the Kansai region
was besieged by a mob,

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:46.630
with over 150 people said to have
been injured in this disturbance.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:48.270
In light of this grave development,

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:50.860
the Osaka Police have set up an
emergency response center to...

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:00.280
Lily bells...

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:07.250
The fourth child of the Gowa Family
died eight years ago

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:09.650
in an experiment taking place
at the stone stage.

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:16.330
But even this did not
dismay Daizaburo.

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:20.630
He made Sorachi's grandson a
substitute for his lost son,

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:24.370
erased the child's memories, and
transplanted those of his dead son.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:27.000
All for the sake of pushing ahead
with the experiments.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:35.520
Big brother, do you remember
our childhood?

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:38.020
In the end, the Gowa look
upon the kai

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:41.520
as a mere tool, a means
to their ends.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:44.160
From the day I realized I was a kai,

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:47.150
I swore to myself that I should
never love another.

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:51.390
Even still, I've come to know you...

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.730
The riots taking place
in the Asian Veins

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.530
are directly linked to the aggregate
grain output levels.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.230
We should not underestimate the
Chinamen's intelligence networks.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:34.840
They seem to have access to better
data than this nation's government.

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:38.210
Hirokawa, have you finished
combing through the details

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.510
of the projected operations scenario?

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.720
Yes, Sir. Overall, there
was little deviation

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.450
from your predictions of where the
optimization curve would be.

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:49.890
If America announces a temporary
suspension of grain exports,

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:53.460
generally speaking, two possible
outcomes can be hypothesized.

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:57.600
First of all, frustrated civilians
will resort to rioting.

00:14:57.600 --> 00:15:01.570
Secondly, the suspension of the
grain exchange market

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.640
will wreak havoc on the economy.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:05.640
In order to counter these disturbances,

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:08.010
we must divide our forces
and station them

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.440
in the greater Tokyo metropolitan
area and the Kansai region.

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:13.180
Furthermore, the units are broken
down into two types

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:16.410
in accordance to their respective
specialty and mission.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:22.550
SSDF mobile units will be deployed
to the Diet and the airports.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.460
Airborne units will be dispatched

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.190
to secure the securities exchange
building in Tokyo and Osaka.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:31.830
Infantry battalions will be deployed
to the Asian Veins

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.030
and the Shinjuku Kabukichou area
in order to put down any rioting.

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:40.460
So, which units have reached their
assigned points at this time?

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:42.480
Within twelve hours,

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:45.540
over seventy percent of the units
will be at their ready positions.

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:49.280
What is it?

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.750
Nothing.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:53.950
How have you been at persuading
the members of the TA company?

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:55.620
Little headway there.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.090
I see.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.790
For the moment, all we need
to do is intimidate,

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.730
and for that, our TA units
should be enough.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.870
I have intelligence informing me that
the United States Armed Forces

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:14.140
are moving toward adopting the TA's
we encountered in Belgistan.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:16.880
If that's the case,

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:19.640
we cannot do without the expertise of
the TA experimentation company.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.640
I will persuade them.

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:26.550
But there is no need for you
to bother yourself with...

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:29.790
Do you have confidence that
you will be successful?

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.330
My confidence in success
is not the concern here.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:34.790
Our concern is that I must succeed.

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.470
If Mr. Nishida is unsuccessful,

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:43.800
we will have to eliminate
Colonel Hayakawa.

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:49.100
After all, the Colonel will be learning
of our plans from this.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:57.050
It seems that my younger brother
Yushiro has headed toward Kyoto.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.520
Toward Kyoto?

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:01.360
I'll have our field agents in Kyoto

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.920
be on the look out for your brother.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:05.390
Thank you.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:11.970
Thank you for all the work, Sir.

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:15.970
This completes the delivery of the
twelve early production models.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:20.170
We brought these here as the
Training Brigade instructed us,

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:22.580
but do you have the facilities here
to conduct the testing?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.710
The TA company is stationed
here currently.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:28.480
They've been here all this time?

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.420
Yes, and they've provided
wonderful assistance.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:32.620
How was it?

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:32.950
Well, it wasn't really different
from all the others.
How was it?

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:35.220
Well, it wasn't really different
from all the others.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:37.960
I suppose the system calibrations
could use a little tightening up.

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.760
Then you can move on.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.830
More TA's came in today.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.930
What?! Even more?

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:48.140
I'll forward to you the trial
itinerary later on.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.730
Hey, wait a minute, Murachu!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.740
Damn it all to hell! This has to be
breaking basic labor laws!

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:58.650
Yes, out of sixteen, not including the
four lost in the recent trials,

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:01.580
fourteen have been passed
the certification tests.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.520
The other two units should complete
their tests in two to three days.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.290
Yes? What about the TA company?

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:10.260
I'd like to have them back here
with me as soon as possible.

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:12.430
Can you expedite the tests?

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:14.460
Yes, Sir. I'll do what I can do.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:15.930
Thank you.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.970
The world's sure turned
into a murky place.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:29.070
Yeah, no kidding.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:40.220
Yo, my man! How are you
doing these days?

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.350
Fine, thanks for all you've done.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:49.460
So, where was he hiding?

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:51.450
What? In the Asian Veins?

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:55.060
What of our local handlers
and contacts?

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:58.700
Unfortunately, we do not have
anyone appropriate on hand.

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:06.280
However, I believe a man who used
be in intelligence resides there.

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:08.650
The intelligence department?

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:13.220
Yes, Sir. With your permission, I
will attempt to contact him.

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:16.690
Please forward to me the dossier
regarding this individual.

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:18.460
Yes, Sir.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.730
After all I've gone through? No deal.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:23.930
Even if this was a request coming
directly from a council member?

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.170
A council member?

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:25.430
Trust me, this is will be a walk in
a park for someone like you.
A council member?

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:29.630
Trust me, this is will be a walk in
a park for someone like you.

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:34.610
We just want you to secure the two
we're looking for. That's all.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:38.910
But years have gone by since I
was banished from Symbol.

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:41.010
Why should I do this for you now?

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:45.050
Of course, we don't intend to have
you do all this for nothing.

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:47.450
We are prepared to compensate
you for your efforts.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:48.660
Compensate?

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:48.960
Information regarding the group you
are currently in conflict against.
Compensate?

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:52.220
Information regarding the group you
are currently in conflict against.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:56.320
Information that I'm sure your
group will find invaluable.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:59.900
First of all, let me send you
photographs of the targets.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:14.480
The mafia has become restless
in anticipation

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.780
of the massive jolt Japan
is about to experience.

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:20.450
With the global heat wave ravaging
agriculture everywhere,

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.720
grain production is going to be
severely hampered this year

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:24.380
by an order of magnitude
you can't imagine.

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:27.830
Either tomorrow or the day after, the
American Department of Agriculture

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:32.330
will release its annual report on the
projected grain harvest index.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.600
The report will reveal that the
projected harvest levels

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.230
are going to be far worse than
originally predicted.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.740
It's only natural that society will
be plunged into chaos,

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:42.880
and long held tensions will manifest
themselves violently.

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.400
When this happens, somebody will
have to be made the scapegoat.

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.510
The Asian Veins!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.150
Yes, they'll wait for that
opportunity to come,

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:53.790
and then enlarge their turf when
all hell breaks loose.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.690
This is what the mafia
are planning to do.

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:58.730
Well the NPSC aren't a
bunch a fools either.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.320
The mafia probably doesn't know their
plans have been predicted.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.860
Yushiro!

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:15.170
We've placed Won under
our surveillance.

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:20.210
Now the question is, will he move
about as we would like to?

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.220
He's heading west on the side street.

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:32.630
Zebra-94,

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:34.090
Charlie-26!

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:49.540
What do you think you're
doing in our town?

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:13.730
You saved me again.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:16.340
Really? Don't worry about it.

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:21.270
I was just chasing off the dogs
that wandered onto our turf,

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.740
Yushiro Gowa.

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:34.550
Hark

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:41.100
It's time I journey

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:51.770
Break apart my heart

00:22:51.940 --> 00:22:58.300
For crimson sadness

00:22:58.630 --> 00:23:05.810
Pours out from it

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:09.730
I can only, oh

00:23:09.840 --> 00:23:12.920
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:18.530
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:33.750 --> 00:23:37.630
I can only, oh

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:40.780
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:45.980
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:47.510 --> 00:23:53.960
I beg you, be by my side

00:24:01.740 --> 00:24:04.040
Miharu, wake up.

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.910
Open your heart again.

00:24:05.910 --> 00:24:08.350
These odors, the commotion,

00:24:08.350 --> 00:24:11.150
they tell of a town where real
people are living real lives.

00:24:11.950 --> 00:24:15.980
But the swell of time encroaches
ever closer without fail.

00:24:16.690 --> 00:24:18.360
Turning away from

00:24:18.360 --> 00:24:21.090
A world boiling over,
engulfed in emotions

00:24:21.090 --> 00:24:23.890
We hide behind these clouded glass
panes of the rear window

00:24:24.760 --> 00:24:29.060
If only we could stay enveloped in
warmth of kindness in this land.
